WEBVTT

00:11:30.936 --> 00:11:33.731
Ever since, I've felt very little regret.

00:11:33.772 --> 00:11:37.818
And I know it's because I shared
my full heart with him

00:11:37.860 --> 00:11:39.528
before it was too late.

00:11:42.906 --> 00:11:45.701
So I hope, I deeply hope,

00:11:45.743 --> 00:11:48.746
that you don't know anyone
who's actively dying.

00:11:49.872 --> 00:11:53.584
But given the times we're in,
that may well not be the case.

00:11:54.585 --> 00:11:56.253
No matter what,

00:11:56.295 --> 00:11:59.298
I encourage you to just look around.